          Architectural definition, training pipeline, and problem specifications for Loan Default Prediction.
        </p>
      </div>
      <span class="badge low" style="font-size:12px; padding:6px 14px;">
        Institutional Lending Task
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Primary Formulation Cards Grid -->
  <div class="metrics-row-4">
    <div class="metric-summary-card">
      <div style="font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:700; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:6px;">Problem Type</div>
      <div style="font-size:20px; font-weight:700; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:4px;">Binary Classification</div>
      <div style="font-size:12px; color:var(--muted);">Supervised Learning ($y \in \{0, 1\}$)</div>
    </div>

    <div class="metric-summary-card">
      <div style="font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:700; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:6px;">Target Column</div>
